{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>油麻地今日（21日）發生屍體發現案。上午11時許，警方接報指，佐敦道37號佐敦大廈一單位內，一名47歲尼泊爾籍持香港身份證的男子近日失聯，朋友報案。</p><p>人員接報到場，經調查後，發現事主倒臥於上址一房間，現場被證實死亡，死因有待驗屍後確定，警方正調查事件原因。</p><figure><img alt=\"佐敦大廈一名47歲尼泊爾籍男子倒斃單位內。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261021/1189636072531824640032754.jpeg/1194R4IJV4vCRVFxRMymrAkcJ_OcdpTLFtXb3hbV294\"/><figcaption>佐敦大廈一名47歲尼泊爾籍男子倒斃單位內。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-21T10:20:07.304683+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":156,"images":1,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T10:02:59+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-21T23:18:13.305718+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-21T10:17:38.952939+00:00","content_hash":"0c41a222eecdf9bd7301c6ce7ae7d1a5adb57444a1f23a963fc58a235605308b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}